IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ADVTWO.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SRC   PIC X(8)  VALUE "ABCDE".
01 WS-REV   PIC X(8)  VALUE "".
01 WS-CH    PIC X(1)  VALUE "".
01 WS-LEN   PIC 9(3)  VALUE 5.
01 WS-I     PIC 9(3)  VALUE 0.
01 WS-AGE   PIC 9(3)  VALUE 25.
01 WS-MEMBER PIC X(1) VALUE "Y".
01 WS-FEE   PIC 9(3)  VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    PERFORM REV-STEP VARYING WS-I FROM WS-LEN BY -1 UNTIL WS-I < 1.
    DISPLAY "rev=" WS-REV.

    EVALUATE WS-AGE ALSO WS-MEMBER
        WHEN 0 THRU 17 ALSO "Y" MOVE 0 TO WS-FEE
        WHEN 0 THRU 17 ALSO "N" MOVE 5 TO WS-FEE
        WHEN 18 THRU 64 ALSO "Y" MOVE 10 TO WS-FEE
        WHEN 18 THRU 64 ALSO "N" MOVE 20 TO WS-FEE
        WHEN OTHER MOVE 0 TO WS-FEE
    END-EVALUATE.
    DISPLAY "fee=" WS-FEE.
    STOP RUN.

REV-STEP.
    MOVE WS-SRC(WS-I:1) TO WS-CH.
    STRING WS-REV WS-CH INTO WS-REV.
